        ['type' => 'unesco', 'data' => [
            'text_en' => 'Inscribed under criterion (iv) as an outstanding example of a fortified settlement whose form — a continuous ring of house façades on an ancient tell, a dense fabric of courtyard houses within — illustrates the whole span of urban life in the region.',
